Welcome to BrlTex, the LaTex to Braille translator which handles mathematics. 
Original author: Michael Whapples, mwhapples@users.sourceforge.net
Contributors: Alastair Irving

This distribution contains the following files:
License	A text file containing the licensing information for BrlTex, should be read by everyone.
INSTALL	a text file containing installation and usage instructions.
install.py an installation script, see INSTALL for usage details.
README	this file.
README.developer	contains information about more technical parts of BrlTex and should be read by anyone who wants 
to do development of BrlTex.
BrlTex.py	the BrlTex script to allow usage of BrlTex where you uninstalled it.
Todo	file containing what needs to be done information.
bauk	the folder containing the bauk part of BrlTex
Each code directory contains:
__init__.py	The renderer file.
translate.py	the text to braille translation module

